Commentary of al-Nasafi (Madarik al-Tanzil) on surah 43, verse 44:

﴿And indeed it﴾: that is, that which was revealed to you;

﴿is a reminder for you﴾: that is, an honour for you;

﴿and for your people﴾: that is, and for your community (ummah);

﴿and you will be questioned﴾ about it on the Day of Resurrection, and about your standing by its right, and about your glorifying it, and about your thanking Allah for this blessing.
